# An undo over a badge: `look ` typed, `shot.png` pasted (its badge), then
# Backspace takes the badge and Ctrl-_ (undo) twice finds nothing to take
# back. Then `shot.png` pasted again, Ctrl-U kills the line with its badge,
# Ctrl-Y yanks it back, and an undo leaves the yank where it is.
models models-image.json
work image-ws
wait 5
type look
key Space
paste shot.png
wait 1.5
snap pasted
key BSpace
wait 0.5
snap deleted
key C-_
wait 0.5
key C-_
wait 0.5
snap undone
paste shot.png
wait 1.5
key C-u
key C-y
wait 0.5
snap yanked
key C-_
wait 0.5
snap yank-undone
